README: Updates and notes on this program.

Version 1.0 lacks the following features:
_ Allowing user to create a settings file on start up and for file to persist after execution.
_ Allowing user to edit settings file while still running the program from GUI.
_ Smart displayname display on text line edit.
_ Smart CheckBox editing
_ Progress Bars for Key parts of the program.
_ Editing of the way the editUsers GUI tells user updates where commited.
_ Fully test deep freeing algorithm for analyzer's sake.
_ Analyze the data structures in the program and make refactoring recommendations
based on design patterns and code readability guidelines.
_ Document all code fully with Headers and functionality comments.
_ Create user manual for Program.

